Subject: [PATCH] feat: Record the last editor of an event
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

events.updated_by is set from the logged admin on update, never from the
form. Event::editor() and editorName() back the 'Última edição por' line
on the admin show page.
